OL,3,GNEWSAVideo diary shows harsh conditions
OL,4,Aof peatland wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree firefighters from one of the
OL,7,Fcountry's only volunteer fire brigades
OL,8,Fhave captured footage of themselves
OL,9,Ftackling a major fire which has been
OL,10,Fburning for nearly a month.
OL,12,FThe team from Peterborough Volunteer
OL,13,FFire Brigade joined efforts to tackle
OL,14,Fthe fire at Holme Fen Nature Reserve,
OL,15,Fnear Peterborough, after it broke out
OL,16,Fon 8 August and drew support from crews
OL,17,Facross the country.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
