OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVideo diary shows harsh conditions
OL,4,Aof peatland wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt its peak, firefighters faced what
OL,7,Fwere described as "unpleasant"
OL,8,Fconditions, including fallen trees,
OL,9,Flimited water supplies, difficult
OL,10,Faccess and hot temperatures.
OL,12,FVolunteer firefighter Samuel Pumpr said
OL,13,Fhe was pushed straight into the
OL,14,Foperation after returning from holiday,
OL,15,Fadding that he was called out 10
OL,16,Fminutes from his train arriving at
OL,17,FPeterborough.
